{"id":"W61014eb173ef76966075e0f6","zh":"自回归滑动平均模型","en":"","name":"自回归滑动平均模型","language":"zh","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","concept_id":"C288e37b9caad43948f6f","families":[],"definition_zh":"结合自回归项和滑动平均项描述时间序列的模型。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W61014eb173ef76966075e0f6","text":"自回归滑动平均模型","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S78c193803ffc5e244523","source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"Perrin等提出的轨道不平顺随机模型(Track Irregularity Stochastic Model, TISM)主要利用Karhunen-Loève(K-L)展开和混沌多项式来表达轨道不平顺随机过程,实现了对大量实测不平顺信号的压缩与相关性识别 [7]; Panunzio等采用几乎与文献[7]相同的方法建立了轨道不平顺随机模型,并开展了车辆动力学的相关研究 [8];Lestoille等结合TISM,采用自回归滑动平均模型(Auto-Regressive Moving Average Model, ARMA)和最小二乘法模拟了轨道不平顺的时变规律,分析了列车的长时效动力性能 [9]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P115":{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W97cf37832d3bef5e6fea2d7c","name":"Auto-Regressive Moving Average Model","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W97cf37832d3bef5e6fea2d7c","name":"Auto-Regressive Moving Average Model","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W97cf37832d3bef5e6fea2d7c","name":"Auto-Regressive Moving Average Model","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal